    "detailed_description": "DotX is a 'mouse only' game, where you will challenge your ability to control the mouse, as well as verify your emotional resistance.<br>Pick up the dots and avoid bumping into the walls, as long as your health bar doesn't reach zero.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/954420/extras/2ac7f5e7c3dc37f94dc0051236e30f22.avif?t=1542038402\" /></div><br><br>100 dynamic and vibrant levels, where you will need the whole of your agility, reaction time, and the mouse handling skill.<br>Look out! Every other 10th level has an increased difficulty.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/954420/extras/e7ba3ada809733fbdf93428ab2d7a6b7.avif?t=1542038402\" /></div><br><br>Enhance and demonstrate your skills by activating one to three challenge modes:<br>- Hard Mode - dots become smaller and speed of the level increases.<br>- Darkness Mode - playing area plunges into darkness.<br>- Perfect Mode - demonstrate an absolutely perfect level walkthrough.<br><br>- Steam Achievements<br>- Steam Cloud",
